# Build context for Dockerfile.dev (all-in-one API + SPA).
# BuildKit picks this up automatically for `-f Dockerfile.dev`, so web/
# SOURCES stay in context (unlike the API-only .dockerignore) while host
# node_modules and stale dist never enter the image.
Dockerfile
Dockerfile.dev
.dockerignore
Dockerfile.dev.dockerignore
.editorconfig
.gitignore
.env*
Makefile
LICENSE
**/*.md
**/*_test.go
*.out
*.test
coverage.*
*.db*
*.db-shm
*.db-wal

# Folders
.git/
.github/
.vscode/
node_modules/
web/node_modules/
web/dist/
build/
dist/
tmp/
data/
